    {
      "id": "CYxkKmr5z1iKVZXVc7JeG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1138.9463551946892,
      "y": 811.2011600294602,
      "width": 1089.1617519248591,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2131485410,
      "version": 176,
      "versionNonce": 1741986900,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792120712891,
      "created": 1791858758960,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive 1: how to handle users who are following a large number of users? -> fanout-on-write",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive 1: how to handle users who are following a large number of users? -> fanout-on-write",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PEvC9IdQYc_BNbMOnkaii",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1129.678620192568,
      "y": 1514.246385849232,
      "width": 1188.9916402154865,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1310517154,
      "version": 699,
      "versionNonce": 579928812,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792120712891,
      "created": 1791858946760,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive 2: how to handle users with a large number of followers? -> fanout-on-read\n- hybrid fanout-on-write & fanout-on-read (User.isCelebrity)\n\nDeep dive 3: how to handle heavy read traffic / uneven read? -> cache (Redis, Local Cache, CDN) k-postId v-post\n\nDeep dive 4: how to handle post with blob(image, video, etc.) -> Blob storage (S3) + presingedURL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive 2: how to handle users with a large number of followers? -> fanout-on-read\n- hybrid fanout-on-write & fanout-on-read (User.isCelebrity)\n\nDeep dive 3: how to handle heavy read traffic / uneven read? -> cache (Redis, Local Cache, CDN) k-postId v-post\n\nDeep dive 4: how to handle post with blob(image, video, etc.) -> Blob storage (S3) + presingedURL",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "wiD7sI97prkRMrkTI6Hpc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 133.08382517644685,
      "y": 105.86826356580337,
      "width": 675.51953125,
      "height": 950,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1976157548,
      "version": 1126,
      "versionNonce": 1195120596,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792143069477,
      "created": 1792120716179,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Post search\n\nFunctional requirements\n- create post\n- like post\n- search post\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (eventually consistent, ~ 1m)\n- latency: low latency for searching post ( < 200 ms)\n- scale: 10M DAU (write >> read, like >> create)\n    write: 10^7 * 10 / 10^5 = 10^3 qps\n    like: 10^7 * 10^2 / 10^5 = 10^4 qps\n    search: 10^7 * 10 / 10^5 = 10^3 qps\n\nCore entities\n- User\n- Post\n- Like\n\nAPI\n- create post\nPOST /post/ -> 200 | postId\nHeader: JWT | session (userId, deviceId...)\nBody: {\n    content: string\n}\n\n- like post\nPOST /like -> 200\nHeader: JWT | session (userId, deviceId...)\nBody: {\n    postId: string\n}\n\n- search post\nGET /search?text={text}&filter={FILTER}&sort={CTIME | LIKES}\n&pageSize={pageSize}&page={page} -> post[]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Post search\n\nFunctional requirements\n- create post\n- like post\n- search post\n\nNon-functional requirements\n- CAP: availability >> consistency (eventually consistent, ~ 1m)\n- latency: low latency for searching post ( < 200 ms)\n- scale: 10M DAU (write >> read, like >> create)\n    write: 10^7 * 10 / 10^5 = 10^3 qps\n    like: 10^7 * 10^2 / 10^5 = 10^4 qps\n    search: 10^7 * 10 / 10^5 = 10^3 qps\n\nCore entities\n- User\n- Post\n- Like\n\nAPI\n- create post\nPOST /post/ -> 200 | postId\nHeader: JWT | session (userId, deviceId...)\nBody: {\n    content: string\n}\n\n- like post\nPOST /like -> 200\nHeader: JWT | session (userId, deviceId...)\nBody: {\n    postId: string\n}\n\n- search post\nGET /search?text={text}&filter={FILTER}&sort={CTIME | LIKES}\n&pageSize={pageSize}&page={page} -> post[]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
