      "text": "Deep dive1: How to handle large volume of reading from user?\n- Cache (TTL < 1m): CDN -> local cache -> distributed cache(redis)\n\nDeep dive2: How to handle multi-keyword, phrase search?\n- option1: search by the single mode and then combine and intersect in the search service's memory (low speed & low storage)\n- option2: build the multi-keyword/phrase as the single keyword in the inverted index (high speed & high storage)\n- combination of 1 and 2: (trade-off of storage and search speed)\n\nDeep dive3: How to handle large volume of writing from user? \n- write post: more service instances + more Kafka partitions & more workers +  more index shards\n- like post: ... + batch (Flink/spark) + approximate like count (log / count-min sketch)\n\nDeep dive4: How to optimize storage?\n- hot/cold: hot storage (Redis/DynamoDB) only store the beginning 1K - 10K items of each keyword, cold storage (Blob) store the remainings\n\nDeep dive5: How to support posting with photo/video?\n- presignedURL + Blob(S3)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive1: How to handle large volume of reading from user?\n- Cache (TTL < 1m): CDN -> local cache -> distributed cache(redis)\n\nDeep dive2: How to handle multi-keyword, phrase search?\n- option1: search by the single mode and then combine and intersect in the search service's memory (low speed & low storage)\n- option2: build the multi-keyword/phrase as the single keyword in the inverted index (high speed & high storage)\n- combination of 1 and 2: (trade-off of storage and search speed)\n\nDeep dive3: How to handle large volume of writing from user? \n- write post: more service instances + more Kafka partitions & more workers +  more index shards\n- like post: ... + batch (Flink/spark) + approximate like count (log / count-min sketch)\n\nDeep dive4: How to optimize storage?\n- hot/cold: hot storage (Redis/DynamoDB) only store the beginning 1K - 10K items of each keyword, cold storage (Blob) store the remainings\n\nDeep dive5: How to support posting with photo/video?\n- presignedURL + Blob(S3)",
